      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the New York City Housing Authority, by resolution adopted on June 30, 1971 has elected, subject to the approval of the Mayor, to continue such increased-take-home-pay plan during the City's 1971-1972 fiscal year; and",
